<article class="post"><header class="post-header"><a class="post-back" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">← 返回文章归档</a><div class="post-kicker"><span class="eyebrow">FIELD NOTES / <%= page.categories.length ? page.categories.first().name : 'UNDEFINED' %></span><span class="eyebrow"><%= noise_reading_time(page.content) %> MIN READ</span></div><h1><%= page.title %></h1><div class="post-meta"><span>BY <b><%= config.author %></b></span><time datetime="<%= date_xml(page.date) %>"><%= date(page.date, 'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time><% if (page.updated && date(page.updated, 'YYYYMMDD') !== date(page.date, 'YYYYMMDD')) { %><span>更新于 <%= date(page.updated, 'YYYY.MM.DD') %></span><% } %></div><div class="post-tags"><% page.tags.each(function(tag) { %><a href="<%- url_for(tag.path) %>"># <%= tag.name %></a><% }) %></div></header><div class="post-grid"><div class="post-body"><div class="prose" id="post-content"><%- page.content %></div><% if (page.original_url) { %><div class="source-note"><span class="eyebrow">FROM THE ARCHIVE</span><p>这篇文章迁移自我的博客园，保留最初的记录。</p><a href="<%= page.original_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">阅读原文 ↗</a></div><% } %><div class="post-end"><span>/ END</span><i>✳</i><span>∷ — 00</span></div></div><aside class="post-sidebar"><div class="toc-box"><span class="eyebrow">ON THIS PAGE / 目录</span><nav aria-label="文章目录"><%- toc(page.content, {list_number: false, max_depth: 3}) %></nav><a href="#main" class="toc-top">↑ 回到文章开头</a></div></aside></div><nav class="post-neighbors" aria-label="相邻文章"><% if (page.prev) { %><a href="<%- url_for(page.prev.path) %>"><span class="eyebrow">← 更新的一篇</span><strong><%= page.prev.title %></strong></a><% } else { %><div></div><% } %><% if (page.next) { %><a href="<%- url_for(page.next.path) %>"><span class="eyebrow">更早的一篇 →</span><strong><%= page.next.title %></strong></a><% } %></nav></article>
